# A new folder and the wizard: let it make the encryption key, keep pinned image versions.
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "mkdir homelab && cd homelab && rostok"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Wait+Line /generate one now/
Sleep 1000ms
Enter
Wait+Line /Image versions/
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Wait+Line /Server name/
Sleep 1s
